v> <div class=\"message\">Do you have a link to this Daily Life in the World thing you are doing? I would love to take a look at it.</div> </div> </div> </div>At this point it's an outline of rough ideas. I just made that snippet up off the top of my head","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T11:18:52-07:00","id":1412622,"title":"","content":"I have to wonder if Heracles is still involved in the Olympics. After all, the guy defined many of the events of the Ancient Greek Olympics, he even paced out several tracks. Heck, he probably hums &quot;I can go the distance&quot; and works with the younger Olympians.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-08T12:28:19-07:00","id":1412629,"title":"","content":"Idea: &quot;International games tend to be affected less by divine interference, as while Odin might throw his spear over one team or the other when both are praying to him, international events are more likely to run into the scenario of him an Nike declaring different victors from each other and checking each